---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  page="about"
  title="Our Story — Made by Hand in Ibadan | That Furniture Girl"
  description="From a phone camera to a full workshop in Iyaganku, Ibadan. How That Furniture Girl builds sectionals, sofa sets, wardrobes and centre tables to order."
>
<section class="page-hero page-hero--ink page-hero--media">
    <div class="page-hero__bg">
      <img src="assets/img/opt/atelier.jpg" alt="The open-air That Furniture Girl workshop in Iyaganku, Ibadan" width="1400" height="933">
    </div>
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Our story</span>
      <h1>Made by hand, in Ibadan.</h1>
      <p class="lead" style="color:rgba(255,253,249,.8); margin-top:20px">You found us on TikTok — probably while scrolling past a cream boucle sectional you couldn't stop thinking about. Behind every one of those videos is a workshop in Iyaganku where the frames are cut, foamed and upholstered by hand.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container split split--wide-left">
      <div class="reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">How it started</span>
        <h2>From a phone camera to a full workshop.</h2>
        <p class="lead" style="margin-top:20px">It started with videos. Short clips of sofas being finished, fabrics being chosen, deliveries going out — posted from Ibadan to anyone who would watch. People started messaging. "Do you deliver to Lagos?" "Can you make this in brown?" "How much for the L-shape?"</p>
        <p style="margin-top:18px">So we built more. Today That Furniture Girl is a handcrafted furniture business with a showroom and workshop at Iyaganku, Ibadan, delivering to homes and offices across Nigeria. Same-day delivery is standard in Ibadan, most pieces are built in 5–10 working days, and nothing leaves the workshop until it's right.</p>
        <p style="margin-top:18px">Our customers aren't strangers — they found us, watched the process, and stayed. That's a responsibility we take seriously. Every piece is built to last, and every price is confirmed before we start cutting.</p>
        <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:30px">
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href="https://www.tiktok.com/@thatfurnituregirl_" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Watch our builds on TikTok</a>
          <a class="btn btn--outline" href="shop.html">See the collection</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="media-frame media-frame--wide reveal" data-delay="1">
        <img src="assets/img/opt/hero-sectionals.jpg" alt="Grey boucle sectional sofa built by That Furniture Girl" width="1400" height="933" loading="lazy">
        <div class="media-badge"><strong>1,101 followers on TikTok</strong><span>and growing every week</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--sand">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head section-head--center reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">What we stand for</span>
        <h2>Built to last. Unique. Classy. Sturdy.</h2>
        <p class="lead" style="margin-top:18px">Four words we say about every piece we make — and the standard we hold the workshop to.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-2" style="margin-top:clamp(34px,5vw,52px); max-width:980px; margin-inline:auto">
        <div class="card reveal">
          <span class="card__num">01</span>
          <h3>Built to last</h3>
          <p>Treated wood frames and high-density foam, so the sofa still feels like a sofa in five years' time.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card reveal" data-delay="1">
          <span class="card__num">02</span>
          <h3>Unique</h3>
          <p>Your colour, your size, your design. Nobody else gets exactly the piece we build for you.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card reveal" data-delay="2">
          <span class="card__num">03</span>
          <h3>Classy</h3>
          <p>Boucle, corduroy, floral fabric and leather — finishes that make a room look finished.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card reveal" data-delay="3">
          <span class="card__num">04</span>
          <h3>Sturdy</h3>
          <p>Nothing flimsy leaves this workshop. We'd rather take longer than cut corners.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container split split--media-second">
      <div class="reveal">
        <span class="eyebrow">The craft</span>
        <h2>What goes into one piece of furniture</h2>
        <ul class="tick-list" style="margin-top:26px">
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8.6 12.3l2.3 2.3 4.6-4.9"/></svg><span><b>Frames</b> — treated wood, joined and reinforced for heavy daily use</span></li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8.6 12.3l2.3 2.3 4.6-4.9"/></svg><span><b>Foam</b> — high-density fill that keeps its shape instead of sagging</span></li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8.6 12.3l2.3 2.3 4.6-4.9"/></svg><span><b>Fabric</b> — boucle, corduroy, floral and leather, with options sent to your phone</span></li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8.6 12.3l2.3 2.3 4.6-4.9"/></svg><span><b>Carcass work</b> — wardrobes, tables and TV stands in HDF and MDF</span></li>
          <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M8.6 12.3l2.3 2.3 4.6-4.9"/></svg><span><b>Finishing</b> — hand-stitched details, tufting, piping and custom colours</span></li>
        </ul>
        <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top:30px">
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href="https://wa.me/2349079849626" data-wa="Hello! I'd like to see fabric options for a piece I have in mind.">Ask for fabric options</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="media-frame media-frame--tall reveal" data-delay="1">
        <img src="assets/img/opt/jewel-sectional.jpg" alt="Chocolate corduroy Jewel sectional sofa on the workshop floor" width="900" height="600" loading="lazy">
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--ink">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="split" style="align-items:center">
        <div class="reveal">
          <span class="eyebrow">Why customers stay</span>
          <h2>“Let's beautify your space.”</h2>
          <p style="margin-top:20px">That's how we sign off most of our videos. It's also the brief: a room should feel better the moment the delivery lands. Ask us anything — we're always active.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid-2 reveal" data-delay="1">
          <div class="card card--dark"><h3 style="font-size:1.05rem">Clear pricing first</h3><p>We confirm the price before we start building — no surprises mid-way.</p></div>
          <div class="card card--dark"><h3 style="font-size:1.05rem">Progress photos</h3><p>You see your piece come together, from frame to final fabric.</p></div>
          <div class="card card--dark"><h3 style="font-size:1.05rem">Fast delivery</h3><p>Same-day in Ibadan, nationwide delivery arranged on request.</p></div>
          <div class="card card--dark"><h3 style="font-size:1.05rem">Real advice</h3><p>Tell us the room and we'll tell you what will actually work in it.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="stats" style="margin-top:clamp(44px,6vw,72px)">
        <div class="stat reveal"><strong>191</strong><span>Videos of our builds</span></div>
        <div class="stat reveal" data-delay="1"><strong>59,230</strong><span>Likes from customers</span></div>
        <div class="stat reveal" data-delay="2"><strong>57,172</strong><span>Views on the Blush Sectional</span></div>
        <div class="stat reveal" data-delay="3"><strong>Same day</strong><span>Delivery in Ibadan</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--tight cta-band">
    <div class="container cta-band__inner">
      <div class="reveal">
        <h2>Come and see what's on the bench.</h2>
        <p style="margin-top:16px; max-width:48ch">Walk-in visits are welcome at Iyaganku, Ibadan — or message us and we'll show you what's ready now.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="btn-row reveal" data-delay="1">
        <a class="btn btn--light btn--lg" href="contact.html">Plan a visit</a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost-light btn--lg" href="https://wa.me/2349079849626" data-wa="Hello! I would like to talk about a piece of furniture.">Chat with us</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</main>


</Base>
